        "code": "// Calls numberInput1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.numberInput1.setValue(42);\nawait components.numberInput1.setText(42);\nawait components.numberInput1.clear();\nawait components.numberInput1.setFocus();\nawait components.numberInput1.setBlur();\nawait components.numberInput1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.numberInput1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.numberInput1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.numberInput1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.numberInput1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.numberInput1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.numberInput1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.numberInput1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.numberInput1.isDisabled, \"isValid\": components.numberInput1.isValid, \"isMandatory\": components.numberInput1.isMandatory, \"value\": components.numberInput1.value, \"label\": components.numberInput1.label };",
